    "notes": "<h3>Normal | Horde, 3 / HP</h3>\n<p><em>Seafaring scoundrels moving in a ravaging pack.</em><br><strong>Motives &amp; Tactics:</strong> Gang up, plunder, raid</p>\n<p><strong>Difficulty:</strong> 12 | <strong>Thresholds:</strong> 5/11 | <strong>HP:</strong> 4 | <strong>Stress:</strong> 3</p>\n<p><strong>ATK:</strong> +1 | Weapon: Melee | 1d8+2 phy</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Experience:</strong> Sailor +3</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<p><strong>Horde (1d4+1) - Passive</strong>: When the Raiders have marked half or more of their HP, their standard attack deals 1d4+1 physical damage instead.</p>\n<p><strong>Swashbuckler - Passive</strong>: When the Raiders mark 2 or fewer HP from an attack within Melee, the attacker must <strong>mark a Stress</strong>.</p>\n",
